      "created_at": "2017-12-01T16:45:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So we went to see Justice League last week, and something in the opening scene caught my attention.</p><p>It starts with a bunch of kids asking Superman some questions for a video blog. One of them asks if he's ever fought a hippo. Another says that's a dumb question and the first kid protests \"It's the most dangerous animal!\"</p><p>I know, the movie was in production well before the Nemesis podcast went live, but I just think it's funny that apparently the DCEU writers and Christopher and Adam ended up on the same page there.</p>",
